--- !u!114 &378397162
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 378397160}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\tMetoda such\xE1/natural, p\u0159i t\xE9to metod\u011B se su\u0161\xED
    cel\xE9 k\xE1vov\xE9 t\u0159e\u0161n\u011B v\u010Detn\u011B du\u017Einy a slupky.
    Tato metoda je levn\u011Bj\u0161\xED, ale vy\u017Eaduje specifick\xE9 klimatick\xE9
    podm\xEDnky. Tato metoda se pou\u017E\xEDv\xE1 nap\u0159\xEDklad v Braz\xEDlii.
    Jde o nejekologi\u010Dt\u011Bj\u0161\xED metodu zpracov\xE1n\xED. Ov\u0161em
    p\u0159\xEDrodn\xED su\u0161en\xED k\xE1vy vede k nekonzistentn\xEDm chu\u0165ov\xFDm
    vlastnostem. Kvalitu mohou i zhor\u0161ovat nezral\xE9 t\u0159e\u0161n\u011B,
    ty su\u0161en\xEDm zhn\u011Bdnou a ovliv\u0148uj\xED chu\u0165 k\xE1vy. Pokud
    je proces proveden spr\xE1vn\u011B dod\xE1v\xE1 k\xE1v\u011B chu\u0165 s n\xE1dechem
    ovoce. \n\n\tK\xE1vov\xE1 t\u0159e\u0161e\u0148 nen\xED zbavena du\u017Einy,
    ty jsou n\xE1sledn\u011B polo\u017Eeny na su\u0161\xEDc\xED stoly \u010Di terasy.
    Po dobu dvou a\u017E \u0161esti t\xFDdn\u016F se za st\xE1l\xE9ho dohledu a ot\xE1\u010Den\xED
    k\xE1vov\xE9 t\u0159e\u0161n\u011B su\u0161\xED.  Po dostate\u010Dn\xE9m usu\u0161en\xED
    se t\u0159e\u0161n\u011B zbav\xED du\u017Einy a pergamenu. \u017D\xE1douc\xED
    m\xEDra vlhkosti je cca 11,5 %.\n\n\tMetoda honey, p\u0159edstavuje kombinaci
    obou metod. V\xFDsledn\xE1 chu\u0165 k\xE1vy je, jako by n\u011Bkdo p\u0159idal
    med a t\u0159tinov\xFD cukr. Zrnka se su\u0161\xED na slunci i s \u010D\xE1st\xED
    lepkav\xE9 du\u017Einy. Chu\u0165 je ovocn\xE1, ale ne tak v\xFDrazn\u011B jako
    u metody such\xE9. Sladkost a chu\u0165 z\xE1vis\xED krom\u011B odr\u016Fdy i
    na mno\u017Estv\xED du\u017Einy ponechan\xE9 p\u0159ed su\u0161en\xEDm. \u010C\xEDm
    v\xEDc du\u017Einy, t\xEDm slad\u0161\xED chu\u0165.\n\n\tProces za\u010D\xEDn\xE1
    zbaven\xEDm k\xE1vov\xE9 t\u0159e\u0161n\u011B vn\u011Bj\u0161\xED \u010D\xE1sti
    du\u017Einy, zrna jsou tak st\xE1le obalena ve vnit\u0159n\xED, lepkav\xE9 \u010D\xE1sti
    du\u017Einy. D\xE1le se zrna nechaj\xED kr\xE1tkou dobu fermentovat, pak se su\u0161\xED
    na slunci. Proces su\u0161en\xED nen\xED oproti such\xE9 metod\u011B tak riskantn\xED,
    jeliko\u017E kv\u016Fli odstran\u011Bn\xED vn\u011Bj\u0161\xED \u010D\xE1sti
    du\u017Einy je men\u0161\xED riziko vzniku pl\xEDsn\xED. Op\u011Bt je optim\xE1ln\xED
    vlhkost 11,5 %."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
